<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Resource and exploration guide" data-copy-zh="资源与探索指南">Resource and exploration guide</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Exploration, Gathering and Hidden Pickups" data-copy-zh="探索、采集与隐藏拾取">Exploration, Gathering and Hidden Pickups</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Choose gathering actions, prepare for search encounters and find repeatable flowers, pickaxes and one-time hidden pickups." data-copy-zh="按需要选择采集行动，为搜索遭遇做好准备，并查鲜花、采矿镐与一次性隐藏拾取的位置。">Choose gathering actions, prepare for search encounters and find repeatable flowers, pickaxes and one-time hidden pickups.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Gathering, searching and small discoveries</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-gathering">Choose a gathering action</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-yield">What changes the yield</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-searching">Search encounters are not safe gathering</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-pickups">Click the scenery for hidden pickups</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-pickup-reference">Optional pickup location reference</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-planning">Spend and replenish deliberately</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">采集、搜索与场景小发现</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-gathering">按需要选择采集行动</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-yield">哪些因素会改变收获</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-searching">搜索可能遇到遭遇事件</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-pickups">直接点击背景寻找隐藏物品</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-pickup-reference">可选：隐藏拾取点位表</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-planning">安排消耗与补充</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><p class="starter-reading-note" data-copy-en="Select a screenshot to enlarge it. Screens show example inventories and progress." data-copy-zh="点击截图可放大查看。图中的库存和进度仅为示例，请以自己的实际情况为准。">Select a screenshot to enlarge it. Screens show example inventories and progress.</p><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><h2>Gathering, searching and small discoveries</h2><p>For cooking supplies, use Nature Walk or Forage Ingredients. For construction supplies, use Gather Materials. Scavenge mixes three resource types at a higher recovery cost. Hidden scene pickups are a separate activity: select a spot in the scenery instead of choosing a timed gathering action.</p></section><section id="en-gathering"><h2>Choose a gathering action</h2><p>The figures below are base minutes / Energy / Calm / Health costs, before applicable reductions. Locations may have their own access requirements. Resources are placed directly into their Common, Rare or Epic stock; gathering does not guarantee a particular rare ingredient or a named quest item.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Where</th><th scope="col">Min / Energy / Calm / Health</th><th scope="col">Base result</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Nature Walk</th><td data-label="Where">Uptown Park</td><td data-label="Min / Energy / Calm / Health">90 / 35 / 0 / 0</td><td data-label="Base result">Five Ingredients; Perception +1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Forage Ingredients</th><td data-label="Where">Royal Hunting Grounds (Edge)<br/>Mountain Foothills<br/>Whispering Woods<br/>Secluded Sanctuary</td><td data-label="Min / Energy / Calm / Health">75 / 40 / 0 / 0</td><td data-label="Base result">Five Ingredients; Perception +1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Gather Materials</th><td data-label="Where">Whispering Woods (Uptown)<br/>Forest Clearing</td><td data-label="Min / Energy / Calm / Health">45 / 20 / 0 / 0</td><td data-label="Base result">Five Materials</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Scavenge</th><td data-label="Where">Surplus Distribution Center</td><td data-label="Min / Energy / Calm / Health">75 / 30 / 30 / 15</td><td data-label="Base result">6–18 mixed Materials, Fabrics and Ingredients</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Collect Moth Silk</th><td data-label="Where">Whispering Woods (Uptown)<br/>Whispering Woods</td><td data-label="Min / Energy / Calm / Health">70 / 20 / 20 / 0</td><td data-label="Base result">Fabrics based on the combined rearing population</td></tr></tbody></table></div><figure class="reviewed-screenshot"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: The modern Uptown woods offer Gather Materials and Collect Moth Silk. Nature Walk is at Uptown Park." href="../assets/images/wiki/exploration-guide/en-forest-gathering.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="The modern Uptown woods offer Gather Materials and Collect Moth Silk. Nature Walk is at Uptown Park." decoding="async" height="720" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/exploration-guide/en-forest-gathering.webp" width="1280"/></a><figcaption>The modern Uptown woods offer Gather Materials and Collect Moth Silk. Nature Walk is at Uptown Park.</figcaption></figure></section><section id="en-yield"><h2>What changes the yield</h2><p>Nature Walk and Forage Ingredients guarantee two Common Ingredients, then roll three additional Ingredients at 80% Common / 16% Rare / 4% Epic each. Gather Materials makes five rolls at those same quality odds. Scavenge rolls 6–18 resources: each is equally likely to be Materials, Fabrics or Ingredients, with quality odds 80% / 18% / 2%.</p><p>Resource Optimization adds one resource at 70% Common / 25% Rare / 5% Epic. For scavenging, this extra is always a Material. A successful effective-Perception percentage check separately adds one resource: effective Luck decides Epic on success, Rare otherwise. The Perception extra for scavenging has a random type. These bonuses add to the base yield.</p><p>All five gathering actions also have an independent 1% chance to raise base Luck by 1. Moth silk uses its own population-based yield; see <a href="game-systems-caterpillar-rearing.html">Caterpillar Rearing</a> for the full production tiers.</p></section><section id="en-searching"><h2>Search encounters are not safe gathering</h2><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Base cost</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Explore Back Alleys</th><td data-label="Location">Back Alleys</td><td data-label="Base cost">45 min; 15 Energy</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Search Cavern</th><td data-label="Location">Sirena Isle → Cavern Interior</td><td data-label="Base cost">45 min; 15 Energy</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>The medieval Back Alleys and the modern Downtown alley are different places. Explore Back Alleys can lead to combat, resource loss, characters, teachers or quest progress. A failed attempt does not mean the relevant event is broken. Active Mittens guild searches and Willow’s mushrooms can take priority over ordinary encounters; a complete result is not guaranteed after a fixed number of attempts.</p><p>Keep recovery stock before searching. Each alley or cavern search has a separate 2% chance of +1 base Luck. Cavern search selects an enemy encounter 40%, another discovery 40%, or nothing 20%. Its battle outcome can separately remove 5–50 Health, Energy and Calm, leaving at least 1 of each; those losses are additional to the search action. Use <a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">the Sirena Isle guide</a> for its cave rewards and access.</p><p>For specific alley progress, use <a href="character-willow.html">Willow</a> · <a href="character-isolde.html">Isolde</a> · <a href="character-mittens.html">Mittens</a> · <a href="character-rain.html">Rain</a>. Mining and its tools have a <a href="game-systems-mining-system.html">separate guide</a>.</p><figure class="reviewed-screenshot"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: The genuine medieval Back Alleys menu includes Explore Back Alleys. It is separate from the modern alley." href="../assets/images/wiki/exploration-guide/en-alley-search.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="The genuine medieval Back Alleys menu includes Explore Back Alleys. It is separate from the modern alley." decoding="async" height="720" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/exploration-guide/en-alley-search.webp" width="1280"/></a><figcaption>The genuine medieval Back Alleys menu includes Explore Back Alleys. It is separate from the modern alley.</figcaption></figure></section><section id="en-pickups"><h2>Click the scenery for hidden pickups</h2><p>Hidden spots are part of ordinary location pictures. They do not always have a visible item icon. Click or tap the indicated scenery while that location is open; successful collection displays a message. Collecting these normal pickups does not advance time or spend Energy. Travelling there still takes its normal time.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Pickup</th><th scope="col">Number of spots</th><th scope="col">Repeat rule</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Flowers</th><td data-label="Number of spots">45</td><td data-label="Repeat rule">1–2 Flowers per spot; returns 6 game days after that spot was collected</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cash</th><td data-label="Number of spots">42</td><td data-label="Repeat rule">One-time per spot</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Voucher</th><td data-label="Number of spots">6</td><td data-label="Repeat rule">One-time per spot</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Mining pickaxes</th><td data-label="Number of spots">15 at Mountain Foothills</td><td data-label="Repeat rule">6 Copper, 6 Iron and 3 Diamond spots; returns after 3 game days</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Respawns use each spot’s own collection day. A flower picked on day 4 returns on day 10; another flower picked on day 5 returns on day 11. Waiting until midnight once does not refill every spot. Seasonal Candy Canes have separate event rules: see <a href="game-systems-christmas-village.html">Christmas Village</a>.</p><figure class="reviewed-screenshot"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: A genuine Uptown Park scene. Flower hotspots are in the scenery; timed Nature Walk is a separate action." href="../assets/images/wiki/exploration-guide/en-park-pickups.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="A genuine Uptown Park scene. Flower hotspots are in the scenery; timed Nature Walk is a separate action." decoding="async" height="720" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/exploration-guide/en-park-pickups.webp" width="1280"/></a><figcaption>A genuine Uptown Park scene. Flower hotspots are in the scenery; timed Nature Walk is a separate action.</figcaption></figure></section><section id="en-pickup-reference"><h2>Optional pickup location reference</h2><p>Optional exact positions below measure <strong>across / down</strong> from the top-left of the game picture, not the browser window. “25% / 75%” means one-quarter across and three-quarters down. Select near the centre of the small target; the picture can scale on different screens.</p><details><summary>Flower locations</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Per spot</th><th scope="col">Across / down</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Future · Artificial Nature Preserve</th><td data-label="Per spot">Flowers ×1</td><td data-label="Across / down">12.7% / 87.8%<br/>51.8% / 82.3%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Future · Artificial Nature Preserve</th><td data-label="Per spot">Flowers ×2</td><td data-label="Across / down">83.0% / 85.1%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Future · Genetically Enhanced Plant Research Dome</th><td data-label="Per spot">Flowers ×2</td><td data-label="Across / down">15.0% / 68.4%<br/>36.1% / 74.0%<br/>65.8% / 74.0%<br/>85.4% / 68.4%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Ancient Earth Shrine</th><td data-label="Per spot">Flowers ×1</td><td data-label="Across / down">71.3% / 87.8%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Castle Garden</th><td data-label="Per spot">Flowers ×1</td><td data-label="Across / down">20.5% / 87.8%<br/>83.4% / 83.7%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Castle Garden</th><td data-label="Per spot">Flowers ×2</td><td data-label="Across / down">28.3% / 68.4%<br/>51.0% / 71.2%<br/>75.2% / 68.4%<br/>71.3% / 85.1%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Castle Garden</th><td data-label="Per spot">Flowers ×3</td><td data-label="Across / down">12.7% / 78.1%<br/>89.3% / 78.1%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Courtyard</th><td data-label="Per spot">Flowers ×1</td><td data-label="Across / down">16.6% / 72.6%<br/>86.9% / 76.7%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Courtyard</th><td data-label="Per spot">Flowers ×2</td><td data-label="Across / down">6.4% / 57.3%<br/>51.0% / 50.3%<br/>79.9% / 53.1%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Mystic's Meditation Grove</th><td data-label="Per spot">Flowers ×1</td><td data-label="Across / down">8.8% / 85.1%<br/>93.2% / 87.8%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Royal Hunting Grounds (Edge)</th><td data-label="Per spot">Flowers ×1</td><td data-label="Across / down">28.3% / 82.3%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Rural Farm</th><td data-label="Per spot">Flowers ×1</td><td data-label="Across / down">7.2% / 92.0%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Secluded Sanctuary</th><td data-label="Per spot">Flowers ×1</td><td data-label="Across / down">8.8% / 90.6%<br/>92.4% / 90.6%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Village Healer's Hut</th><td data-label="Per spot">Flowers ×1</td><td data-label="Across / down">93.2% / 82.3%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Present · Downtown Park</th><td data-label="Per spot">Flowers ×1</td><td data-label="Across / down">76.0% / 87.8%<br/>42.4% / 76.7%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Present · Downtown Park</th><td data-label="Per spot">Flowers ×2</td><td data-label="Across / down">22.9% / 87.8%<br/>59.6% / 77.4%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Present · Farmers Market</th><td data-label="Per spot">Flowers ×1</td><td data-label="Across / down">4.9% / 78.1%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Present · Hidden Waterfall</th><td data-label="Per spot">Flowers ×1</td><td data-label="Across / down">10.4% / 92.0%<br/>22.9% / 85.1%<br/>86.9% / 92.0%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Present · Local Café</th><td data-label="Per spot">Flowers ×1</td><td data-label="Across / down">13.5% / 75.3%<br/>86.9% / 80.9%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Present · Mountain Foothills (Uptown)</th><td data-label="Per spot">Flowers ×1</td><td data-label="Across / down">86.9% / 87.8%<br/>94.7% / 82.3%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Present · Uptown Park</th><td data-label="Per spot">Flowers ×1</td><td data-label="Across / down">46.3% / 60.1%<br/>62.7% / 53.1%<br/>14.3% / 90.6%<br/>54.5% / 60.1%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Present · Whispering Woods (Uptown)</th><td data-label="Per spot">Flowers ×1</td><td data-label="Across / down">16.6% / 90.6%</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><details><summary>One-time cash locations</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Per spot</th><th scope="col">Across / down</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Future · Glitch's Den</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×115</td><td data-label="Across / down">40.4% / 85.8%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Future · Hyperloop Transit Nexus</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×60</td><td data-label="Across / down">24.8% / 78.8%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Future · Industrial Waste Processing Zone</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×95</td><td data-label="Across / down">32.6% / 85.8%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Future · Multi-Level Automated Parking Complex</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×80</td><td data-label="Across / down">51.4% / 94.1%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Future · Neural Club</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×100</td><td data-label="Across / down">87.3% / 81.6%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Future · Resistance Hideout</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×130</td><td data-label="Across / down">20.9% / 80.2%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Future · Surplus Distribution Center</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×70</td><td data-label="Across / down">67.8% / 84.4%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Future · Synergy Corp Corporate Tower</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×140</td><td data-label="Across / down">75.6% / 78.8%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Future · Unregistered Housing Complex</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×75</td><td data-label="Across / down">9.2% / 74.7%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Future · VOID Central Command Headquarters</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×150</td><td data-label="Across / down">17.0% / 83.0%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Back Alleys</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×85</td><td data-label="Across / down">13.9% / 84.4%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Bandit Hideout</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×120</td><td data-label="Across / down">63.9% / 77.4%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Barn Interior</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×80</td><td data-label="Across / down">23.2% / 76.0%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Black Market</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×130</td><td data-label="Across / down">83.4% / 84.4%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Blacksmith Shop</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×75</td><td data-label="Across / down">28.7% / 80.2%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Caravan Rest Stop</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×90</td><td data-label="Across / down">17.0% / 83.0%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Grand Ballroom</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×110</td><td data-label="Across / down">83.4% / 85.8%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Monastery Scriptoria</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×55</td><td data-label="Across / down">51.4% / 78.8%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Peasant Huts</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×50</td><td data-label="Across / down">28.7% / 91.3%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Rowdy Alehouse</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×65</td><td data-label="Across / down">71.7% / 88.5%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Thieves Guild</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×150</td><td data-label="Across / down">8.8% / 63.5%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Throne Room</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×140</td><td data-label="Across / down">11.5% / 83.0%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Traveler's Inn Tavern</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×70</td><td data-label="Across / down">43.6% / 80.2%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Underground Catacombs</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×100</td><td data-label="Across / down">38.9% / 88.5%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Village Market</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×60</td><td data-label="Across / down">51.4% / 88.5%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Present · Back Alley</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×75</td><td data-label="Across / down">13.5% / 79.5%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Present · Basement</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×70</td><td data-label="Across / down">87.3% / 76.0%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Present · City Beach (Uptown)</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×110</td><td data-label="Across / down">60.0% / 88.5%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Present · City Gym (Uptown)</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×80</td><td data-label="Across / down">10.7% / 83.0%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Present · City Library (Uptown)</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×100</td><td data-label="Across / down">8.0% / 57.3%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Present · City Street (Downtown)</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×55</td><td data-label="Across / down">51.4% / 91.3%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Present · Corner Convenience Store</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×50</td><td data-label="Across / down">69.3% / 83.0%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Present · Dojo</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×75</td><td data-label="Across / down">87.3% / 78.8%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Present · Downtown Bar</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×60</td><td data-label="Across / down">31.1% / 85.8%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Present · Downtown Restaurant</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×90</td><td data-label="Across / down">50.6% / 77.4%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Present · Food Court (Mall)</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×65</td><td data-label="Across / down">38.9% / 85.8%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Present · Living Room</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×150</td><td data-label="Across / down">72.9% / 47.6%<br/>62.5% / 46.9%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Present · Metro Station (Uptown)</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×50</td><td data-label="Across / down">17.0% / 71.9%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Present · Night Club</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×120</td><td data-label="Across / down">46.7% / 94.8%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Present · Retro Arcade</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×50</td><td data-label="Across / down">91.2% / 74.7%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Present · Spa</th><td data-label="Per spot">Cash ×85</td><td data-label="Across / down">25.6% / 64.2%</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><details><summary>Voucher locations</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Per spot</th><th scope="col">Across / down</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Future · Hyperloop Transit Nexus</th><td data-label="Per spot">Voucher ×1</td><td data-label="Across / down">77.1% / 47.6%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Future · Surplus Distribution Center</th><td data-label="Per spot">Voucher ×1</td><td data-label="Across / down">75.4% / 56.0%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Hidden Chamber</th><td data-label="Per spot">Voucher ×1</td><td data-label="Across / down">68.1% / 64.8%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Present · Clothing Store (Mall)</th><td data-label="Per spot">Voucher ×1</td><td data-label="Across / down">59.7% / 45.8%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Present · Metro Station (Downtown)</th><td data-label="Per spot">Voucher ×1</td><td data-label="Across / down">90.7% / 64.4%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Present · Retro Arcade</th><td data-label="Per spot">Voucher ×1</td><td data-label="Across / down">66.2% / 53.1%</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><details><summary>Respawning pickaxe locations</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Per spot</th><th scope="col">Across / down</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Mountain Foothills</th><td data-label="Per spot">Copper Pickaxe ×1</td><td data-label="Across / down">73.2% / 92.0%<br/>44.7% / 97.6%<br/>98.6% / 43.4%<br/>7.2% / 79.5%<br/>31.1% / 73.3%<br/>86.5% / 78.1%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Mountain Foothills</th><td data-label="Per spot">Diamond Pickaxe ×1</td><td data-label="Across / down">93.6% / 97.6%<br/>26.4% / 58.7%<br/>97.9% / 59.4%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Medieval · Mountain Foothills</th><td data-label="Per spot">Iron Pickaxe ×1</td><td data-label="Across / down">83.4% / 66.3%<br/>55.3% / 97.6%<br/>17.0% / 97.6%<br/>69.3% / 52.4%<br/>37.3% / 87.8%<br/>70.1% / 44.8%</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details></section><section id="en-planning"><h2>Spend and replenish deliberately</h2><p>Ingredients are cooking stock, Materials are construction stock and Fabrics are another separate stock. A higher-tier resource does not automatically replace a lower-tier cost. Check <a href="items.html">Items and Cooking</a> before converting Ingredients into Food, and compare prices in <a href="walkthrough-wealth-guide.html">Wealth and Work</a> when deciding whether to gather or buy.</p><p>For a missing action, check the correct era, exact location and access conditions. For a missing hidden pickup, check whether it was already collected and whether its own respawn day has arrived. Quest discoveries also need their specific active prerequisites; gathering ordinary stock does not substitute for those steps.</p></section></div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><h2>采集、搜索与场景小发现</h2><p>缺食材时，选「自然散步」或「采集食材」；缺建造材料时，选「采集材料」。「搜刮」能取得三类资源，但恢复成本更高。场景中的隐藏拾取点则是另一种玩法：直接点击背景中的位置，不是选择耗时的采集行动。</p></section><section id="zh-gathering"><h2>按需要选择采集行动</h2><p>下表消耗依次为基础分钟数／精力／镇定／生命，尚未计入适用减免。地点本身仍有进入条件。收获直接加入普通、稀有或史诗资源库存；一次采集并不保证取得某种稀有资源，也不保证取得具名任务物品。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">分钟／精力／镇定／生命</th><th scope="col">基础收获</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">自然散步</th><td data-label="地点">上城公园</td><td data-label="分钟／精力／镇定／生命">90 / 35 / 0 / 0</td><td data-label="基础收获">5份食材；感知+1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">采集食材</th><td data-label="地点">皇家狩猎场（边缘）<br/>山脚<br/>低语森林<br/>隐秘圣所</td><td data-label="分钟／精力／镇定／生命">75 / 40 / 0 / 0</td><td data-label="基础收获">5份食材；感知+1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">采集材料</th><td data-label="地点">低语森林（上城区）<br/>林中空地</td><td data-label="分钟／精力／镇定／生命">45 / 20 / 0 / 0</td><td data-label="基础收获">5份材料</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">搜刮</th><td data-label="地点">剩余物资分配中心</td><td data-label="分钟／精力／镇定／生命">75 / 30 / 30 / 15</td><td data-label="基础收获">6–18份材料、布料与食材，种类随机</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">采集蛾丝</th><td data-label="地点">低语森林（上城区）<br/>低语森林</td><td data-label="分钟／精力／镇定／生命">70 / 20 / 20 / 0</td><td data-label="基础收获">按两地饲养总量获得布料</td></tr></tbody></table></div><figure class="reviewed-screenshot"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：现代的低语森林（上城区）提供「采集材料」与「采集蛾丝」；「自然散步」在上城公园。" href="../assets/images/wiki/exploration-guide/zh-forest-gathering.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="现代的低语森林（上城区）提供「采集材料」与「采集蛾丝」；「自然散步」在上城公园。" decoding="async" height="720" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/exploration-guide/zh-forest-gathering.webp" width="1280"/></a><figcaption>现代的低语森林（上城区）提供「采集材料」与「采集蛾丝」；「自然散步」在上城公园。</figcaption></figure></section><section id="zh-yield"><h2>哪些因素会改变收获</h2><p>「自然散步」与「采集食材」先固定获得2份普通食材，再分别判定另外3份：每份有80%概率为普通、16%为稀有、4%为史诗。「采集材料」按相同比例判定5份材料。「搜刮」先决定6–18份收获，每份等概率属于材料、布料或食材，品质比例为80%／18%／2%。</p><p>「资源优化」额外增加1份资源，品质比例为普通70%、稀有25%、史诗5%；在「搜刮」中，这一份固定是材料。另有一次按有效感知判定的额外收获：成功后再按有效幸运判定，成功给史诗，否则给稀有；搜刮的这份额外资源种类随机。这些奖励都加在基础收获之外。</p><p>上述五种采集行动，还各有独立1%概率使基础幸运+1。蛾丝使用独立的种群产量规则，完整档位见<a href="game-systems-caterpillar-rearing.html">毛虫繁育</a>。</p></section><section id="zh-searching"><h2>搜索可能遇到遭遇事件</h2><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">基础消耗</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">探索后巷</th><td data-label="地点">后巷</td><td data-label="基础消耗">45分钟；15精力</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">搜索洞窟</th><td data-label="地点">塞壬岛洞穴内部</td><td data-label="基础消耗">45分钟；15精力</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>中世纪的后巷与现代市中心的后巷不是同一地点。「探索后巷」可能遇到战斗、资源损失、人物、教师或任务事件；一次没有遇到目标，并不代表任务失效。Mittens的公会搜索任务与Willow的蘑菇可能优先出现，不能保证尝试固定次数就一定完成。</p><p>搜索前留好恢复物品。后巷和洞窟搜索各有独立2%概率使基础幸运+1。洞窟搜索有40%概率遇敌、40%遇到其他发现、20%没有发现；战斗结果可能分别扣除5–50生命、精力与镇定，各项最低留1。这些损失在搜索行动消耗之外。洞窟奖励与进入条件见<a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">塞壬岛度假村指南</a>。</p><p>后巷具体路线可查<a href="character-willow.html">Willow</a>、<a href="character-isolde.html">Isolde</a>、<a href="character-mittens.html">Mittens</a>与<a href="character-rain.html">Rain</a>。采矿与镐的使用另见<a href="game-systems-mining-system.html">采矿指南</a>。</p><figure class="reviewed-screenshot"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：实际中世纪后巷菜单中的「探索后巷」。这里与现代的后巷分别提供不同内容。" href="../assets/images/wiki/exploration-guide/zh-alley-search.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="实际中世纪后巷菜单中的「探索后巷」。这里与现代的后巷分别提供不同内容。" decoding="async" height="720" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/exploration-guide/zh-alley-search.webp" width="1280"/></a><figcaption>实际中世纪后巷菜单中的「探索后巷」。这里与现代的后巷分别提供不同内容。</figcaption></figure></section><section id="zh-pickups"><h2>直接点击背景寻找隐藏物品</h2><p>隐藏拾取点位于普通地点背景中，不一定显示独立物品图标。进入对应地点后，点击或轻触指定区域；成功拾取会出现提示。这类普通拾取本身不推进时间，也不消耗精力；前往地点的旅行仍按正常规则耗时。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">拾取内容</th><th scope="col">点位数量</th><th scope="col">重复获取规则</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">鲜花</th><td data-label="点位数量">45处</td><td data-label="重复获取规则">每处1–2份；该处拾取后第6个游戏日恢复</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">财富</th><td data-label="点位数量">42处</td><td data-label="重复获取规则">每处仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">兑换券</th><td data-label="点位数量">6处</td><td data-label="重复获取规则">每处仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">采矿镐</th><td data-label="点位数量">山脚共15处</td><td data-label="重复获取规则">铜镐6处、铁镐6处、钻石镐3处；拾取后第3个游戏日恢复</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>每个点位单独计时。例如第4天摘的花，第10天恢复；第5天摘的另一处，第11天恢复。过一次午夜，并不会让所有点位一起刷新。节庆拐杖糖使用独立规则，见<a href="game-systems-christmas-village.html">圣诞村</a>。</p><figure class="reviewed-screenshot"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：上城公园实景：鲜花拾取点位于背景中，菜单里的「自然散步」是另一项耗时行动。" href="../assets/images/wiki/exploration-guide/zh-park-pickups.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="上城公园实景：鲜花拾取点位于背景中，菜单里的「自然散步」是另一项耗时行动。" decoding="async" height="720" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/exploration-guide/zh-park-pickups.webp" width="1280"/></a><figcaption>上城公园实景：鲜花拾取点位于背景中，菜单里的「自然散步」是另一项耗时行动。</figcaption></figure></section><section id="zh-pickup-reference"><h2>可选：隐藏拾取点位表</h2><p>下方可选点位表从<strong>游戏画面左上角</strong>量起，依次为横向／纵向位置，不含浏览器边框。「25%／75%」表示从左数四分之一、从上数四分之三。点击小区域中心附近即可；不同设备上画面可能等比例缩放。</p><details><summary>鲜花点位</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">每处收获</th><th scope="col">横向／纵向</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 乡村农场</th><td data-label="每处收获">鲜花 ×1</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">7.2% / 92.0%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 修行者冥想林</th><td data-label="每处收获">鲜花 ×1</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">8.8% / 85.1%<br/>93.2% / 87.8%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 城堡花园</th><td data-label="每处收获">鲜花 ×1</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">20.5% / 87.8%<br/>83.4% / 83.7%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 城堡花园</th><td data-label="每处收获">鲜花 ×2</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">28.3% / 68.4%<br/>51.0% / 71.2%<br/>75.2% / 68.4%<br/>71.3% / 85.1%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 城堡花园</th><td data-label="每处收获">鲜花 ×3</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">12.7% / 78.1%<br/>89.3% / 78.1%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 庭院</th><td data-label="每处收获">鲜花 ×1</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">16.6% / 72.6%<br/>86.9% / 76.7%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 庭院</th><td data-label="每处收获">鲜花 ×2</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">6.4% / 57.3%<br/>51.0% / 50.3%<br/>79.9% / 53.1%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 村庄治疗师小屋</th><td data-label="每处收获">鲜花 ×1</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">93.2% / 82.3%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 皇家狩猎场（边缘）</th><td data-label="每处收获">鲜花 ×1</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">28.3% / 82.3%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 远古大地神殿</th><td data-label="每处收获">鲜花 ×1</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">71.3% / 87.8%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 隐秘圣所</th><td data-label="每处收获">鲜花 ×1</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">8.8% / 90.6%<br/>92.4% / 90.6%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">未来 · 人工自然保护区</th><td data-label="每处收获">鲜花 ×1</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">12.7% / 87.8%<br/>51.8% / 82.3%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">未来 · 人工自然保护区</th><td data-label="每处收获">鲜花 ×2</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">83.0% / 85.1%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">未来 · 基因强化植物研究穹顶</th><td data-label="每处收获">鲜花 ×2</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">15.0% / 68.4%<br/>36.1% / 74.0%<br/>65.8% / 74.0%<br/>85.4% / 68.4%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">现代 · 上城公园</th><td data-label="每处收获">鲜花 ×1</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">46.3% / 60.1%<br/>62.7% / 53.1%<br/>14.3% / 90.6%<br/>54.5% / 60.1%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">现代 · 低语森林（上城区）</th><td data-label="每处收获">鲜花 ×1</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">16.6% / 90.6%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">现代 · 农贸市场</th><td data-label="每处收获">鲜花 ×1</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">4.9% / 78.1%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">现代 · 山脚（上城区）</th><td data-label="每处收获">鲜花 ×1</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">86.9% / 87.8%<br/>94.7% / 82.3%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">现代 · 市中心公园</th><td data-label="每处收获">鲜花 ×1</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">76.0% / 87.8%<br/>42.4% / 76.7%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">现代 · 市中心公园</th><td data-label="每处收获">鲜花 ×2</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">22.9% / 87.8%<br/>59.6% / 77.4%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">现代 · 本地咖啡馆</th><td data-label="每处收获">鲜花 ×1</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">13.5% / 75.3%<br/>86.9% / 80.9%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">现代 · 隐藏瀑布</th><td data-label="每处收获">鲜花 ×1</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">10.4% / 92.0%<br/>22.9% / 85.1%<br/>86.9% / 92.0%</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><details><summary>一次性财富点位</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">每处收获</th><th scope="col">横向／纵向</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 修道院抄写室</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×55</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">51.4% / 78.8%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 农民小屋</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×50</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">28.7% / 91.3%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 后巷</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×85</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">13.9% / 84.4%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 商队休息站</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×90</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">17.0% / 83.0%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 喧闹酒馆</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×65</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">71.7% / 88.5%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 地下墓穴</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×100</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">38.9% / 88.5%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 大舞厅</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×110</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">83.4% / 85.8%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 强盗藏身处</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×120</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">63.9% / 77.4%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 旅人旅店酒馆</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×70</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">43.6% / 80.2%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 村庄市场</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×60</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">51.4% / 88.5%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 王座厅</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×140</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">11.5% / 83.0%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 盗贼公会</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×150</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">8.8% / 63.5%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 谷仓内部</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×80</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">23.2% / 76.0%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 铁匠铺</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×75</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">28.7% / 80.2%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 黑市</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×130</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">83.4% / 84.4%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">未来 · Glitch的藏身处</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×115</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">40.4% / 85.8%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">未来 · VOID中央指挥总部</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×150</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">17.0% / 83.0%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">未来 · 剩余物资分配中心</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×70</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">67.8% / 84.4%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">未来 · 反抗军藏身处</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×130</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">20.9% / 80.2%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">未来 · 多层自动停车楼</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×80</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">51.4% / 94.1%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">未来 · 工业废料处理区</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×95</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">32.6% / 85.8%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">未来 · 新能集公司企业塔</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×140</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">75.6% / 78.8%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">未来 · 未注册住宅区</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×75</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">9.2% / 74.7%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">未来 · 神经俱乐部</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×100</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">87.3% / 81.6%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">未来 · 超环交通枢纽</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×60</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">24.8% / 78.8%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">现代 · 后巷</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×75</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">13.5% / 79.5%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">现代 · 地下室</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×70</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">87.3% / 76.0%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">现代 · 地铁站（上城区）</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×50</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">17.0% / 71.9%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">现代 · 城市健身房（上城区）</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×80</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">10.7% / 83.0%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">现代 · 城市图书馆（上城区）</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×100</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">8.0% / 57.3%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">现代 · 城市海滩（上城区）</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×110</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">60.0% / 88.5%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">现代 · 城市街道（市中心）</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×55</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">51.4% / 91.3%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">现代 · 复古游戏厅</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×50</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">91.2% / 74.7%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">现代 · 夜店</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×120</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">46.7% / 94.8%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">现代 · 客厅</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×150</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">72.9% / 47.6%<br/>62.5% / 46.9%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">现代 · 市中心酒吧</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×60</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">31.1% / 85.8%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">现代 · 市中心餐厅</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×90</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">50.6% / 77.4%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">现代 · 水疗馆</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×85</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">25.6% / 64.2%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">现代 · 美食广场（商场）</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×65</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">38.9% / 85.8%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">现代 · 街角便利店</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×50</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">69.3% / 83.0%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">现代 · 道场</th><td data-label="每处收获">财富 ×75</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">87.3% / 78.8%</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><details><summary>兑换券点位</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">每处收获</th><th scope="col">横向／纵向</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 隐藏密室</th><td data-label="每处收获">兑换券 ×1</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">68.1% / 64.8%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">未来 · 剩余物资分配中心</th><td data-label="每处收获">兑换券 ×1</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">75.4% / 56.0%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">未来 · 超环交通枢纽</th><td data-label="每处收获">兑换券 ×1</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">77.1% / 47.6%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">现代 · 地铁站（市中心）</th><td data-label="每处收获">兑换券 ×1</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">90.7% / 64.4%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">现代 · 复古游戏厅</th><td data-label="每处收获">兑换券 ×1</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">66.2% / 53.1%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">现代 · 服装店（商场）</th><td data-label="每处收获">兑换券 ×1</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">59.7% / 45.8%</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><details><summary>可刷新的采矿镐点位</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">每处收获</th><th scope="col">横向／纵向</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 山脚</th><td data-label="每处收获">钻石镐 ×1</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">93.6% / 97.6%<br/>26.4% / 58.7%<br/>97.9% / 59.4%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 山脚</th><td data-label="每处收获">铁镐 ×1</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">83.4% / 66.3%<br/>55.3% / 97.6%<br/>17.0% / 97.6%<br/>69.3% / 52.4%<br/>37.3% / 87.8%<br/>70.1% / 44.8%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">中世纪 · 山脚</th><td data-label="每处收获">铜镐 ×1</td><td data-label="横向／纵向">73.2% / 92.0%<br/>44.7% / 97.6%<br/>98.6% / 43.4%<br/>7.2% / 79.5%<br/>31.1% / 73.3%<br/>86.5% / 78.1%</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details></section><section id="zh-planning"><h2>安排消耗与补充</h2><p>食材供烹饪使用，材料用于建造，布料又是另一类库存。高级资源不能自动代替低级资源支付费用。将食材转成食物前，可先查<a href="items.html">道具与烹饪</a>；决定采集还是购买时，可参考<a href="walkthrough-wealth-guide.html">财富与工作</a>。</p><p>行动没有出现时，先核对时代、具体地点与访问条件。隐藏点位没有反应时，检查是否已经取过，以及该处是否到了恢复日。任务发现还需要对应前置；普通资源数量再多，也不能代替具名任务步骤。</p></section></div><p class="starter-credits"><a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/" rel="license">CC BY-SA 4.0</a><span data-copy-en=". Game images © Chronoromancer Studio." data-copy-zh="。游戏图片 © Chronoromancer Studio。">. Game images © Chronoromancer Studio.</span></p></article>
</div></section>
